fn gui_sfnt_simple_glyph_outline_point_read_drain_validate %fn &GuiSfntSimpleGlyphOutlineStorage fn GuiSfntSimpleGlyphPointStream fn GuiSfntSimpleGlyphOutlinePointReadCursor Result GuiSfntSimpleGlyphOutlinePointReadDrainValidation GuiSfntSimpleGlyphOutlinePointReadDrainError \storage\stream\cursor:
