//: gui_sfnt_simple_glyph_outline_point_stream_item_collection_curve_segment: collection から curve segment を[読/よ]む
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - F5x contour edge lookup を exactly once [呼/よ]び、edge/span invariant を[再検査/さいけんさ]してから curve 分類へ進みます。
//: - start が on-curve かつ end が off-curve の場合だけ F5w lookahead point lookup を[呼/よ]びます。
//: - needed lookahead failure は `LookaheadPointFailed` として[返/かえ]し、`MissingLookahead` success へ変換しません。
//:
//: neplg2:test[skip]
pub fn gui_sfnt_simple_glyph_outline_point_stream_item_collection_curve_segment %fn &GuiSfntSimpleGlyphOutlinePointStreamItemCollection fn i32 fn i32 Result GuiSfntSimpleGlyphCurveSegment GuiSfntSimpleGlyphOutlinePointStreamItemCollectionCurveSegmentError \collection\contour_index\edge_index:
    let capacity %GuiSfntSimpleGlyphOutlineStorageCapacity gui_sfnt_simple_glyph_outline_point_stream_item_collection_capacity collection
    let item_count %i32 gui_sfnt_simple_glyph_outline_point_stream_item_collection_item_count collection
    let items_len %i32 gui_sfnt_simple_glyph_outline_point_stream_item_collection_items_len collection
