            gui_sfnt_glyf_point_stream_from_topology bytes glyf topology

//: gui_sfnt_glyf_simple_point_with_tables: metadata 済み table から simple point を[引/ひ]く
//:
//: neplg2:test[skip]
fn gui_sfnt_glyf_simple_point_with_tables %fn &ByteBuf fn GuiSfntTableRecord fn GuiSfntTableRecord fn GuiSfntTableRecord fn GuiSfntMetrics fn GuiGlyphId fn i32 Result GuiSfntSimpleGlyphPoint GuiSfntParseError \bytes\head\loca\glyf\metrics\glyph\point_index:
    match gui_sfnt_glyf_simple_point_stream_with_tables bytes head loca glyf metrics glyph:
