//: gui_sfnt_glyf_simple_contour_span_with_tables: metadata 済み table から simple contour span を[引/ひ]く
//:
//: neplg2:test[skip]
fn gui_sfnt_glyf_simple_contour_span_with_tables %fn &ByteBuf fn GuiSfntTableRecord fn GuiSfntTableRecord fn GuiSfntTableRecord fn GuiSfntMetrics fn GuiGlyphId fn i32 Result GuiSfntSimpleGlyphContourSpan GuiSfntParseError \bytes\head\loca\glyf\metrics\glyph\contour_index:
    match gui_sfnt_glyf_simple_topology_with_tables bytes head loca glyf metrics glyph:
        Result::Err error:
